WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.800
When a team adds AI to a job,
someone has to decide who does what.

2
00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:10.520
I start by watching people do the work,
and I list every task in it.

3
00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:15.150
Then I score each task on a scale.

4
00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:17.700
At one end, a person does it alone.

5
00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:20.200
At the other end, the machine does.

6
00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:22.450
Four questions set the level:

7
00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:26.250
what it costs if the result is wrong,
whether it can be undone,

8
00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:28.950
how often it comes up,
and who answers for it.

9
00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:35.100
The result is a table:
each task, its level, and the reason.

10
00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:37.860
The team can use it,
and they can question it.
